      trivia: "【Games with Initials】The initials of the six original Brown Label vitolas (Havana Cazadore, Unicos, Noella, Taino, Especiale, Regios) spell HUNTER, the name of Johnson's beloved dog, while those of the six Havana VI vitolas (Hermosos, Angeles, Victorias, Artistas, Nobles, Almirantes) spell HAVANA. Johnson's playfulness is inscribed in the very names.\n【Monsters Every Hallowe'en】The Monster Series, themed on the monsters of classic horror — Frankenstein, Dracula, Leatherface and their kin — became an annual fixture, released in small limited numbers each autumn."
